  DialogueNodeData:
  - Guid: a6b7e102-6f17-4bac-92ca-32c0b5cffedf
    DialogueText: Howdy buddy. If you’re looking for protection, you’ve come to the right place.
    DialogueNodeLabel: ENTRY
    Position: {x: 81, y: 481}
    choices:
    - Guid: bde67d91-d643-42e4-90d9-24328a830415
      ChoiceText: What do you sell?
      ChoiceLabel:
    - Guid: e42545c6-9a1b-446a-9b78-32206250dc59
      ChoiceText: Thanks
      ChoiceLabel:
    VoiceLine: 1
  - Guid: 5ab070c2-f16e-4673-8ca9-2852767b789c
    DialogueText: Melee weapons - blunt and sharp, and of course, firearms. Ammo too. I get more stuff in stock every now and then.
    DialogueNodeLabel:
    Position: {x: 668, y: 420}
    choices:
    - Guid: ab07d064-ae57-4b68-a059-330881ee938e
      ChoiceText: Are these weapons legal?
      ChoiceLabel:
    - Guid: 808d739a-1418-4673-a87c-9f657d386571
      ChoiceText: Thanks
      ChoiceLabel:
    VoiceLine: 0
  - Guid: 7d0f65ec-0286-4955-9e88-621c826ed3db
    DialogueText: Yeahhhh, more or less. Most of them are probably not completely non-illegal… what’re you askin' for anywho?
    DialogueNodeLabel:
